Today is Saturday morning.
I have come to the neighbourhood community café.
Today is my first day of volunteering.
The café is very busy.
I can smell fresh coffee right from the outside.
I want to meet more of the local people here.
That is why I am learning to work at the café's counter.
I am standing in front of the door.
I am feeling a little nervous.
But I am also very excited.
I came to Mumbai for work in January.
Since then, I have learned a lot about this city.
Now I am making it my home.
I slowly push the door.
Inside, people are drinking tea and coffee.
Some people are talking loudly.
I take a deep breath.
I go inside with a smile.
